{"PageNumber":497,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":19,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَأَن لَّا تَعۡلُواْ عَلَى ٱللَّهِۖ إِنِّيٓ ءَاتِيكُم بِسُلۡطَٰنٖ مُّبِينٖ","TajweedText":"وَأ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>َن ل</tajweed>َّا تَعْلُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> عَلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ‌ۖ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> ءَاتِيك<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِسُلْطَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>نٍ م</tajweed>ُّب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>١٩</span>","End":"١٩","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":431,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":20,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِنِّي عُذۡتُ بِرَبِّي وَرَبِّكُمۡ أَن تَرۡجُمُونِ","TajweedText":"وَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>ِى عُذْتُ بِرَبِّى وَرَبِّكُمْ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ت</tajweed>َرْجُم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٢٠</span>","End":"٢٠","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":431,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":21,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِن لَّمۡ تُؤۡمِنُواْ لِي فَٱعۡتَزِلُونِ","TajweedText":"وَإ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ل</tajweed>َّمْ تُؤْمِنُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> لِى فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>عْتَزِل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٢١</span>","End":"٢١","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":431,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":22,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَدَعَا رَبَّهُۥٓ أَنَّ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ قَوۡمٞ مُّجۡرِمُونَ","TajweedText":"فَدَعَا رَبَّهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ هَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>ؤُل<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ قَوْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مٌ م</tajweed>ُّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>رِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٢</span>","End":"٢٢","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":431,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":23,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَأَسۡرِ بِعِبَادِي لَيۡلًا إِنَّكُم مُّتَّبَعُونَ","TajweedText":"فَأَسْرِ بِعِبَادِى لَيْلاً إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ُّتَّبَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٣</span>","End":"٢٣","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":431,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":24,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱتۡرُكِ ٱلۡبَحۡرَ رَهۡوًاۖ إِنَّهُمۡ جُندٞ مُّغۡرَقُونَ","TajweedText":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تْرُكِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْبَحْرَ رَهْوًا‌ۖ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُمْ جُن<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>دٌ م</tajweed>ُّغْرَق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٤</span>","End":"٢٤","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":431,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":25,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"كَمۡ تَرَكُواْ مِن جَنَّـٰتٖ وَعُيُونٖ","TajweedText":"كَمْ تَرَكُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ج</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>تٍ و</tajweed>َعُي<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٢٥</span>","End":"٢٥","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":431,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":26,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَزُرُوعٖ وَمَقَامٖ كَرِيمٖ","TajweedText":"وَزُرُو<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>عٍ و</tajweed>َمَقَا<tajweed class=ikhafa>مٍ ك</tajweed>َر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٍ <span class=end>٢٦</span>","End":"٢٦","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":431,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":27,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَنَعۡمَةٖ كَانُواْ فِيهَا فَٰكِهِينَ","TajweedText":"وَنَعْمَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ةٍ ك</tajweed>َانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> فِيهَا فَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كِه<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٧</span>","End":"٢٧","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":431,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":28,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"كَذَٰلِكَۖ وَأَوۡرَثۡنَٰهَا قَوۡمًا ءَاخَرِينَ","TajweedText":"كَذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَ‌ۖ وَأَوْرَثْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هَا قَوْمًا ءَاخَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٨</span>","End":"٢٨","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":431,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":29,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَمَا بَكَتۡ عَلَيۡهِمُ ٱلسَّمَآءُ وَٱلۡأَرۡضُ وَمَا كَانُواْ مُنظَرِينَ","TajweedText":"فَمَا بَكَتْ عَلَيْهِمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءُ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضُ وَمَا كَانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نظ</tajweed>َر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٩</span>","End":"٢٩","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":431,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":30,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَقَدۡ نَجَّيۡنَا بَنِيٓ إِسۡرَـٰٓءِيلَ مِنَ ٱلۡعَذَابِ ٱلۡمُهِينِ","TajweedText":"وَلَقَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed> نَجَّيْنَا بَن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> إِسْر<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َٲ</tajweed>ٓءِيلَ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَذَابِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُه<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٣٠</span>","End":"٣٠","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":432,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":31,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"مِن فِرۡعَوۡنَۚ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ عَالِيٗا مِّنَ ٱلۡمُسۡرِفِينَ","TajweedText":"مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ف</tajweed>ِرْعَوْنَ‌ۚ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> كَانَ عَالِ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>يًا م</tajweed>ِّنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُسْرِف<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣١</span>","End":"٣١","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":432,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":32,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَقَدِ ٱخۡتَرۡنَٰهُمۡ عَلَىٰ عِلۡمٍ عَلَى ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","TajweedText":"وَلَقَدِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>خْتَرْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ عَلَىٰ عِلْمٍ عَلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٢</span>","End":"٣٢","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":432,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":33,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَءَاتَيۡنَٰهُم مِّنَ ٱلۡأٓيَٰتِ مَا فِيهِ بَلَـٰٓؤٞاْ مُّبِينٌ","TajweedText":"وَءَاتَيْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَيَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِ مَا فِيهِ بَلَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ؤٌاْ م</tajweed>ُّب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٌ <span class=end>٣٣</span>","End":"٣٣","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":432,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":34,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ لَيَقُولُونَ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ هَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>ؤُل<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ لَيَقُول<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٤</span>","End":"٣٤","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":432,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":35,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنۡ هِيَ إِلَّا مَوۡتَتُنَا ٱلۡأُولَىٰ وَمَا نَحۡنُ بِمُنشَرِينَ","TajweedText":"إِنْ هِىَ إِلَّا مَوْتَتُنَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأُولَىٰ وَمَا نَحْنُ بِمُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نش</tajweed>َر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٥</span>","End":"٣٥","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":432,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":36,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَأۡتُواْ بِـَٔابَآئِنَآ إِن كُنتُمۡ صَٰدِقِينَ","TajweedText":"فَأْتُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِـَٔـاب<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓئِن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ صَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>دِق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٦</span>","End":"٣٦","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":432,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":37,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَهُمۡ خَيۡرٌ أَمۡ قَوۡمُ تُبَّعٖ وَٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبۡلِهِمۡ أَهۡلَكۡنَٰهُمۡۚ إِنَّهُمۡ كَانُواْ مُجۡرِمِينَ","TajweedText":"أَهُمْ خَيْرٌ أَمْ قَوْمُ تُبَّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>عٍ و</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لِهِمْ‌ۚ أَهْلَكْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ‌ۖ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُمْ كَانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>رِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٧</span>","End":"٣٧","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":432,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":38,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمَا خَلَقۡنَا ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ وَمَا بَيۡنَهُمَا لَٰعِبِينَ","TajweedText":"وَمَا خَلَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>نَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>و<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>تِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضَ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا لَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>عِب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٨</span>","End":"٣٨","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":432,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":44,"SurahIndex":"044","VerseNumber":39,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"مَا خَلَقۡنَٰهُمَآ إِلَّا بِٱلۡحَقِّ وَلَٰكِنَّ أَكۡثَرَهُمۡ لَا يَعۡلَمُونَ","TajweedText":"مَا خَلَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>نَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَّا بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَقِّ وَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ أَكْثَرَهُمْ لَا يَعْلَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٩</span>","End":"٣٩","PageNumber":497,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":432,"MaqraNumber":199,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false}]}